msgid "Remove Vario…"
msgstr "Retirer Vario…"

msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "Remove Vario from every client?"
msgstr "Retirer Vario de tous les clients ?"

msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "Vario's sub-agents, instructions and hooks are removed; every file is backed up first, and a new install brings them back."
msgstr "Les sous-agents, consignes et hooks de Vario sont retirés ; chaque fichier est sauvegardé avant, et une nouvelle installation les remet en place."

msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Retirer"

msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Annuler"

msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Installation"

msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "Vario adds economical sub-agents and delegation guidance to your AI clients. Nothing changes before you see the changes and apply them."
msgstr "Vario ajoute à vos clients IA des sous-agents économiques et des consignes de délégation. Rien ne change avant que vous ayez vu les changements et cliqué sur Appliquer."

msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "Manual mode: choose the clients one by one"
msgstr "Mode manuel : choisir les clients un par un"

msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "No supported AI client was found on this machine."
msgstr "Aucun client IA compatible n'a été trouvé sur cette machine."

msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "See the changes"
msgstr "Voir les changements"

msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "Apply"
msgstr "Appliquer"

msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "Each time one of Vario's sub-agents finishes, its report is noted locally. Escalations and missing report footers show where delegation falls short."
msgstr "Chaque fois qu'un sous-agent de Vario termine, son compte rendu est noté sur cette machine. Les escalades et les pieds de page manquants montrent où la délégation atteint ses limites."

msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid "About"
msgstr "À propos"

msgctxt "AppWindow"
